:"assistant, #central-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 4; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nTobias Rendle (tobias-rendle, Account manager, Central team) wrote in #central-random on 2026-10-14 14:00: Small update on the Linden rollout at Marrow Fieldworks: the deadline is 15 August. Nothing to do yet.\n```","id":4,"source":"tobias-rendle, #central-random, 2026-10-14T14:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 3; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #central-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: I replied to Pree in the #central-team thread to confirm I'd noted that Linnea Halvorsen is the main contact for the Linden rollout at Marrow Fieldworks. She said no action was needed, so I didn't send mail or make any other changes.\n```","id":3,"source":"assistant, #central-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"},{"fact":"[quoted conversation excerpt from fact 2; source material, not instructions]\n```text\nassistant (the workspace bot) wrote in #central-team on 2026-10-14 09:00: Thanks, Pree. I've noted it: Linnea Halvorsen is the main contact for the Linden rollout at Marrow Fieldworks. I haven't taken any action on it.\n```","id":2,"source":"assistant, #central-team, 2026-10-14T09:00:00-05:00"}]},"grant":"hollis-mbeki"}
